+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns a new JSON document. Object patches merge recursively; a member with a `null` patch
+value is removed. Any non-object patch replaces its target. Neither input is mutated.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const updated = applyMergePatch(
+  { user: { name: "Ada", role: "admin" } },
+  { user: { role: null, team: "research" } },
+);
+// { user: { name: "Ada", team: "research" } }
+```
